notes.content:
We decided that the gameplay in the old demo was very boring, the narrative was not revealed in any way. Because of this, it is not very pleasant to play such a demo. So we changed everything! 

What awaits you:
- A bunch of weird characters in the office;
- Signing contracts for speed, which will cause the office to change;
- Some creepy creature follows you around;
- A HUGE GLOWING CAT, WOW!

Where to get all this wonder? Right on our Steam page!

And so you don't get bored while downloading the latest build, check out what creepy and atmospheric trailer we put together: 

